### 1. Connect to Avaya PBX (Run this first!)
POST https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/system/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "adminProviderString": "AVAYA#AVAYAPOCCM2#CSTA#APSAES01;loginID=avayacti;passwd=Iccs@123"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 2. Make a Phone Call (Click-to-Call)
POST https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sourceExtension": "56001",
    "clientNumber": "08307753758"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 2b. Answer/Accept an Incoming Call
POST https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/call/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "extension": "56001"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 3. Start Webhook Monitoring for Multiple Extensions
POST https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/monitor
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "extensions": ["56001", "56002", "56003"],
    "webhookUrl": "httpss://webhook.site/b5ffe974-e61e-4414-a719-3e5cf249df85"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 4. Agent Login (Log into a Support Queue)
POST https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/agent/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "agentId": "66001",
    "extension": "56002",
    "password": "123456"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 5. Change Agent State (Set to Ready / Not Ready)
POST https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/agent/state
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "agentId": "66002",
    "isAvailable": true
}

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 6. Agent Logout (End of Shift)
POST https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/agent/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "agentId": "66002",
    "extension": "56001"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 7. Get Live Agent Status in a Queue
GET https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/queue/70/agents
Content-Type: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 8. Find where a specific Agent is Logged In
GET https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/agent/66002/status
Content-Type: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 9. Get Active Call Details (live duration, caller/called info)
GET https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/call/56001/details
Content-Type: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------

### 10. Get Call History (last 100 calls with duration)
GET https://avaya.lumirex.tech/api/telephony/call/history
Content-Type: application/json
